#*: {{quote|en|Once, Cookie even tried to get me to give it a go with Jez – can you believe the nerve of that? 'Why would I want to do that? He's '''minging'''.' 'Why not? It won't hurt.  He never gets a shag.' 'No, Cookie. Bloody hell.' He hasn't got a clue. 'Wouldn't you be jealous?' 'No.' 'You're an idiot. Why do you think he never gets a shag?' 'Why?' 'Because he's '''minging'''!' 'So? I'm '''minging'''. We're all '''minging'''. None of us are exactly page three, are we, Billie?' 'Speak for yourself.' I didn't go round there for ages.}}
